OL,5,G1340 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FHarriet wants a holiday home in
OL,7,     Fthe popular resort of Villamartin
OL,8,     Fon Spain's Costa Blanca. Property
OL,9,     Fexpert Lee Juggurnauth finds five
OL,10,     Ffabulous homes for her budget of
OL,11,     F#110,000.
OL,12,G1440 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FGloucestershire. IT manager Bea
OL,14,     Fserves up an international night
OL,15,     Finspired by her travels. But
OL,16,     Fthere's confusion over her Cretan
OL,17,     Ffeta and her geographical guessing
OL,18,     Fgame goes nowhere. (Ep1/5)
