OL,5,G1825 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FTony and Paula host the week's
OL,7,     Fthird visit at Hotel Ellenby in
OL,8,     FScarborough, where they reckon
OL,9,     Fstunning sea views and local
OL,10,     Fhistory will be a winning
OL,11,     Fcombination. The breakfast, not so
OL,12,     Fmuch.
OL,13,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FThe week's final visit is to The
OL,15,     FCrown Inn in Derbyshire, where a
OL,16,     Ftrip to an old mill proves to be
OL,17,     Finexplicably popular. More so than
OL,18,     FDean's supposedly legendary
OL,19,     Fbreakfast, anyway...
