OL,5,G1930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FPeace. Tranquillity. Relaxation.
OL,7,     FUnfortunately, it's payment day,
OL,8,     Fso there's none of that here.
OL,9,     FInstead, there are slanderous
OL,10,     Fsleep scores, bad breakfasts, and
OL,11,     Fa no-show from two B&Bers!
OL,12,G2000 Griff's Canadian Adventure
OL,13,     FComedian Griff Rhys Jones explores
OL,14,     Fthe world's second-biggest
OL,15,     Fcountry. In Newfoundland and
OL,16,     FLabrador he discovers sea
OL,17,     Fshanties, cod tongue, jellybean
OL,18,     Fhouses and noonday cannons.
OL,19,     F(Ep1/6)
